21:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Where is the FLEX Global Pakistan application form?",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Where is the FLEX Global Pakistan application form?"}],[["$","p","The global Apply page sends Pakistan applicants to the country office, rather than the online route used for some other countries. Confirm the current local instructions, availability and cut-off through that official route. This review does not publish an unverified Pakistan deadline or claim that a form is open.",{"children":"The global Apply page sends Pakistan applicants to the country office, rather than the online route used for some other countries. Confirm the current local instructions, availability and cut-off through that official route. This review does not publish an unverified Pakistan deadline or claim that a form is open."}],["$","p","The directory lists flexglobal.pk@siepk.org for Pakistan. Use the programme website and its official directory to confirm the contact before sending an enquiry. Keep application documents within the programme’s requested channel.",{"children":"The directory lists flexglobal.pk@siepk.org for Pakistan. Use the programme website and its official directory to confirm the contact before sending an enquiry. Keep application documents within the programme’s requested channel."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Where is the FLEX Global Pakistan application form?","children":[["$","$L4","https://flexglobalpakistan.org/",{"href":"https://flexglobalpakistan.org/","children":["Open FLEX Global Pakistan",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","https://www.discoverfl