26:["$","section","3-Start at the official country route",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Start at the official country route"}],[["$","p","For 2027–28, the official Apply to FLEX Global page directs applicants in Pakistan, Argentina, Brazil, India, Indonesia and several other countries to their country office. A general login link found in another country’s announcement may not be your correct first step.",{"children":"For 2027–28, the official Apply to FLEX Global page directs applicants in Pakistan, Argentina, Brazil, India, Indonesia and several other countries to their country office. A general login link found in another country’s announcement may not be your correct first step."}],["$","p","Use the country contact listed on Discover FLEX Global. Ask which application form, recruitment deadline, school grades and birth-date window apply to your recruitment round. Do not carry an old YES-programme eligibility list into a new FLEX Global cycle without confirmation.",{"children":"Use the country contact listed on Discover FLEX Global. Ask which application form, recruitment deadline, school grades and birth-date window apply to your recruitment round. Do not carry an old YES-programme eligibility list into a new FLEX Global cycle without confirmation."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Start at the official country route","children":[["$","$L4","https://www.discoverflexglobal.org/apply-to-flex",{"href":"https://www.discoverflexglobal.org/apply-to-flex","children":["Official country application instructions",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","https://www.discoverflexglobal.org/contact-us",{"href":"https://www.discoverflexglobal.org/contact-us","children":["Find the official country office",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
27:["$","section","4-Make a personal eligibility sheet",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make a personal eligibility sheet"}],[["$","p","Record your citizenship, country of schooling, current school year and exact date of birth separately. The word “international” does not mean every nationality or school grade is eligible. If a criterion uses a specific reference date, calculate your age on that date rather than on the day you read this guide.",{"children":"Record your citizenship, country of schooling, current school year and exact date of birth separately. The word “international” does not mean every nationality or school grade is eligible. If a criterion uses a specific reference date, calculate your age on that date rather than on the day you read this guide."}],["$","p","Students approaching school completion should ask how the exchange would interact with graduation or entrance examinations. Parents should also check what happens on return: an exchange year and a locally recognised school year are not automatically identical.",{"children":"Students approaching school completion should ask how the exchange would interact with graduation or entrance examinations. Parents should also check what happens on return: an exchange year and a locally recognised school year are not automatically identical."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L2e",null,{"id":"guides/flex-global-exchange-program:section-5","title":"Check your progress","items":["Find the current country-specific age or birth-date condition.","Confirm your school grade and enrolment status are eligible.","Read the programme’s citizenship and previous-U.S.-stay conditions.","Check whether any family/employment or visa-related exclusion applies.","Discuss return-to-school arrangements with your school before committing."]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
28:["$","section","5-Understand the experience behind the scholarship",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Understand the experience behind the scholarship"}],[["$","p","The official programme describes living with a host family, attending a U.S. high school and taking part in community and leadership activities. This is an organised educational exchange, not a route to choose any school, city or job.",{"children":"The official programme describes living with a host family, attending a U.S. high school and taking part in community and leadership activities. This is an organised educational exchange, not a route to choose any school, city or job."}],["$","p","Before agreeing to participate, discuss the programme rules as a family. Ask about communication with home, supervision, health information, school expectations and who handles a concern. A student should understand the commitment independently, not apply only because someone else likes the funding headline.",{"children":"Before agreeing to participate, discuss the programme rules as a family. Ask about communication with home, supervision, health information, school expectations and who handles a concern. A student should understand the commitment independently, not apply only because someone else likes the funding headline."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
29:["$","section","6-Compare covered support with questions still to ask",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Compare covered support with questions still to ask"}],[["$","p","Use the current programme brochure and country office to confirm the package, including travel, placement, insurance and personal support. Check what is covered directly and whether there are personal expenses or exclusions. Never assume that all medical situations or family travel are included.",{"children":"Use the current programme brochure and country office to confirm the package, including travel, placement, insurance and personal support. Check what is covered directly and whether there are personal expenses or exclusions. Never assume that all medical situations or family travel are included."}],["$","p","Create two columns: “confirmed by the programme” and “question for the office”. Keep the source beside each answer. This is more useful than forwarding a benefits graphic whose date and country are missing.",{"children":"Create two columns: “confirmed by the programme” and “question for the office”. Keep the source beside each answer. This is more useful than forwarding a benefits graphic whose date and country are missing."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Questions for the student and parent discussion","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Questions for the student and parent discussion"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Area",{"scope":"col","children":"Area"}],["$","th","Question to resolve",{"scope":"col","children":"Question to resolve"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Placement"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"How are school and host-family arrangements made?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Health"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Which costs and conditions does the programme insurance cover?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Documents"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Which passport, school and consent records are needed, and when?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Return"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"How will the home school handle the year abroad?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","4",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Support"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Who is the official contact during selection and during the exchange?"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2a:["$","section","7-Prepare evidence for selection without scripting a new personality",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare evidence for selection without scripting a new personality"}],[["$","p","Use real school, family, community or extracurricular situations to explain how you solve problems and adapt. A modest example that you understand is stronger than an impressive activity you cannot explain. Selection instructions differ, so follow the tasks and permitted assistance in your actual application.",{"children":"Use real school, family, community or extracurricular situations to explain how you solve problems and adapt. A modest example that you understand is stronger than an impressive activity you cannot explain. Selection instructions differ, so follow the tasks and permitted assistance in your actual application."}],["$","p","An evidence bank can have four columns: situation, your action, result and reflection. The reflection matters: what would you do differently next time? Do not buy essays or memorise somebody else’s story.",{"children":"An evidence bank can have four columns: situation, your action, result and reflection. The reflection matters: what would you do differently next time? Do not buy essays or memorise somebody else’s story."}]],"$undefined","$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"sample-card","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"sample-card__label","children":"Teaching example"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Turning an ordinary experience into evidence"}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Situation: our class group missed a project milestone. My action: I asked each member what was unfinished, helped divide the remaining tasks and checked progress before the next meeting. Reflection: I learned to agree responsibilities early instead of assuming everyone had the same plan."}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"sample-card__note","children":"Fictional preparation example, not an official selection answer or scoring rubric."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2b:["$","section","8-Keep one timeline for school, selection and travel",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-9","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep one timeline for school, selection and travel"}],[["$","p","Write the country deadline and the programme year at the top of your tracker. Add each official request as it arrives, with an owner: student, parent, school or referee. Check your email and spam folder, but use the programme office to verify unexpected messages asking for payment or sensitive documents.",{"children":"Write the country deadline and the programme year at the top of your tracker. Add each official request as it arrives, with an owner: student, parent, school or referee. Check your email and spam folder, but use the programme office to verify unexpected messages asking for payment or sensitive documents."}],["$","p","A draft form or an essay file is not a confirmation of submission. Save the acknowledgement and keep your contact details working. If the deadline for your country has passed, ask the office about the correct future-round information rather than trying a different country’s portal.",{"children":"A draft form or an essay file is not a confirmation of submission. Save the acknowledgement and keep your contact details working. If the deadline for your country has passed, ask the office about the correct future-round information rather than trying a different country’s portal."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2c:["$","section","9-Your next action",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Your next action"}],[["$","p","If you are a Pakistani applicant, begin with the official Pakistan contact, not the U.S.-citizen Global Abroad form. If you are not a high-school applicant, the university exchange hub is a better starting point.",{"children":"If you are a Pakistani applicant, begin with the official Pakistan contact, not the U.S.-citizen Global Abroad form. If you are not a high-school applicant, the university exchange hub is a better starting point."}],["$","p","This page intentionally does not publish one universal age limit or closing date. A correct country-specific answer is more useful than a confident rule that excludes eligible readers or encourages an invalid application.",{"children":"This page intentionally does not publish one universal age limit or closing date. A correct country-specific answer is more useful than a confident rule that excludes eligible readers or encourages an invalid application."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Your next action","children":[["$","$L4","/exchange-programs/",{"href":"/exchange-programs/","children":["Compare exchange programmes",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/scholarships-for-pakistani-students/",{"href":"/guides/scholarships-for-pakistani-students/","children":["Explore student funding options",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
2d:["$","section","10-Questions to resolve before preparing your application",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-11","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Questions to resolve before preparing your application"}],[["$","p","Ask the country office about the exact recruitment cycle, application channel, deadline/time zone and treatment of your current school year. If you are near the birth-date boundary or studying a different school system, obtain an answer before relying on a general overview.",{"children":"Ask the country office about the exact recruitment cycle, application channel, deadline/time zone and treatment of your current school year. If you are near the birth-date boundary or studying a different school system, obtain an answer before relying on a general overview."}],["$","p","Keep one checklist with eligibility evidence, teacher/school tasks, any selection stages and return-to-school arrangements. A high-school exchange should not be mixed into an undergraduate degree-scholarship shortlist.",{"children":"Keep one checklist with eligibility evidence, teacher/school tasks, any selection stages and return-to-school arrangements. A high-school exchange should not be mixed into an undergraduate degree-scholarship shortlist."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Questions to resolve before preparing your application","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/undergraduate-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/",{"href":"/guides/undergraduate-scholarships-for-pakistani-students/","children":["Pakistan undergraduate scholarship routes",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/scholarships-in-pakistan/",{"href":"/guides/scholarships-in-pakistan/","children":["Scholarships for study within Pakistan",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
